@title EMC fix-it: the previewed fix drawn before and after on the Cabinet plate
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# "On the plate" in the preview card opens the Cabinet with the EMC layer and the same Before / After banner; Cancel drops the preview. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-bonding.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
scroll 360 400 -300
wait 10
click_text "Preview: Scrape the mounting area bare" #1
wait 10
click_text "On the plate"
wait 40
expect "Previewing a fix"
shot 01-after
check_layout
click_text Before #1
wait 20
shot 02-before
check_layout
click_text Cancel #1
wait 20
expect_not "Previewing a fix"
shot 03-cancelled
check_layout
